 <h3><u>Areeza e darvaish</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Hussain...<br> Sooz e dilam, ka'ba e mann, karbobalai<br> na mikhwaham, jahanam<br> Hussain, hussain<br> Na mikhwaham..(3)<br> sada bezan... sada bezann<br> na mikhwaham ee jahaan sada bezan<br> sada bezan... sada bezann<br> na mikhwaham ee jahaan sada bezan</p> 
  <p>Dil ke arbab mere<br> kab mujhe izn mile<br> jald bulwa le mujhe<br> sada bezan... sada bezann<br> na mikhwaham ee jahaan sada bezan</p> 
  <p>Sooz e dilam, ka'ba e mann, karbobalai..(2)<br> Ya hussain....<br> Aye mere dard ke mehram maula<br> door hai tujhse ye beemar tera..(2)<br> dil ye seene me na reh payega<br> jald bulwa le mujhe karbobala</p> 
  <p>sada bezan... sada bezann<br> na mikhwaham ee jahaan sada bezan</p> 
  <p>Allah humma arzuqna ziyaratal hussain<br> Ya hussain</p> 
  <p>Arbaeen ho ke wo ho ashura<br> ek sailaab azadaro ka<br> shukr ka karta hai tujhko sajda<br> Hussain, hussain..(2)</p> 
  <p>Aye khuda,<br> Ma ke dil na darum<br> magar ma ke dil na darum aye khuda</p> 
  <p>un croro mein bus ek mai hi nahi..(2)<br> soch kar phat-ta hai dil ye mera</p> 
  <p>sada bezan... sada bezann<br> na mikhwaham ee jahaan sada bezan</p> 
  <p>Sun le armaan mere<br> koi tadbeer bane<br> tera deedaar mile</p> 
  <p>sada bezan... sada bezann<br> na mikhwaham ee jahaan sada bezan</p> 
  <p>Sooz e dilam, ka'ba e mann, karbobalai..(2)<br> Ya hussain....</p> 
  <p>Khadim e za'ereen ke sadqe<br> sooz e shahbaaz e qalandar dede..(2)<br> yehi nauha hi areeza hai mera<br> ab to darvaish ko didaar mile</p> 
  <p>sada bezan... sada bezann<br> na mikhwaham ee jahaan sada bezan</p> 
  <p>Chahe kuch bhi na bache<br> karbala dil mein rahe<br> jab talak saans chale</p> 
  <p>sada bezan... sada bezann<br> na mikhwaham ee jahaan sada bezan<br> Hussain, hussain..(2)<br> Hussain hussain hussain</p> 
